  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solomon Islands Australia Health Partnership 2025 - 2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Solomon Islands Australia Health Partnership (Health Partnership) supports the Ministry of Health and Medical Services to strengthen essential health services nationwide. The investment focuses on improving provincial service delivery, upgrading key health facilities, and supporting women in health leadership. It also advances jointly agreed national health priorities and initiatives to improve quality, safety, accessibility, and climate resilience in health care. This partnership succeeds the Health Sector Support Program Phase 3.</narrative>
  </description>
